like watching Garfield.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:28.380
- I don't even have anything
to drink or eat next to me

00:04:28.380 --> 00:04:31.290
if it gets in my way, I'm
like so in (laughter).

00:04:31.290 --> 00:04:33.580
I did the whole Friends set,
I haven't done Harry Potter

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:34.960
but yes, you were cooler than us

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.271
'cause you were in Harry Potter.

00:04:36.271 --> 00:04:38.210
- I mean honestly, I was a
little damn like ten years late

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:39.530
